calarsi nei panni delle vittime."},{"language":"en-US","title":"St Barts","overview":"Officer Gabriel Saint-Barthélémy isn’t your average detective. Growing up in a resort on a Caribbean island, he knows both the bright and the dark side of paradise. Saint Barts is a chameleon-like inspector, very good at putting himself in his victims’ shoes. And when it comes to solving cases on this paradisiacal Caribbean Island frequented by VIPs, being a Very Intrusive Policeman proves to be particularly effective.","tagline":"You would swear he’s a saint!"},{"language":"fr-FR","overview":"Le commandant Gabriel Saint-Barthélémy a grandi dans un resort sur une île des Caraïbes. Connaissant mieux que personne les coulisses du paradis, il a la fâcheuse manie de mener ses enquêtes en se tapant l’incruste. Une méthode renversante, mais toujours payante !"}],"images":{"logos":[{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/mvovd0p7rVpJFutzWpzyqTtxLpa.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/mvovd0p7rVpJFutzWpzyqTtxLpa.png","language":"fr","width":4319,"height":552}],"posters":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/l5GLjCvM29Dc9lvE6DD3v9TzWPQ.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/l5GLjCvM29Dc9lvE6DD3v9TzWPQ.jpg","language":"it","width":1000,"height":1500},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/kGb4Hhal7cQ4YZ1sMkdBxt3jd7u.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/kGb4Hhal7cQ4YZ1sMkdBxt3jd7u.jpg","language":"en","width":666,"height":1000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/fUJX2Oz3Ag9wSFqlFckWlitzb2Y.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/fUJX2Oz3Ag9wSFqlFckWlitzb2Y.jpg","language":"fr","width":800,"height":1200},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/yDTCytW2TND3Kd6XaZ0fZ2NPeoE.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/yDTCytW2TND3Kd6XaZ0fZ2NPeoE.jpg","language":"fr","width":770,"height":1155}],"backdrops":[{"type":"backdrop","url":"ht